    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present to the market this spacious and immaculately presented three bedroom duplex in the ever popular Paddocks Square, Adamstown, Co Dublin. The exclusive gated development of The Paddocks Square is nestled in between central Adamstown and Lucan Village and has every imaginable amenity on its doorstep. Within a stones throw you will find local bars, shops, schools along with a host of bus route, the N4 & M50 and Adamstown Train Station. Interior living accommodation of c. 112 Sq m can be found here and in brief consists of entrance hall, wc, storage cupboard, open plan kitchen/diner and lounge to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find 3 double bedrooms, 2 with balconies, master ensuite and also the family bathroom. No.13 comes to the market in fantastic condition throughout and further benefits from gas fire heating, secure underground parking and offers no onward chain. We expect this property to be extremely popular so early viewing is advised to not miss out on this fantastic property. Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers.\n\n\nKey Features\nBER B2\nC 112 Sq m\nSecure gated complex\nUnderground parking\nDouble glazed windows\nc. 2100 per annum management fees\nImmaculate throughout\nLarge kitchen/diner\nExclusive development\nGas heating\nEnsuite to master\nWalking distance to all local amenities\nViewing highly advised\n\nDirections\nFrom the N4, take the Newcastle/Adamstown exit and continue straight on past Supervalue Shopping Complex. At the first set on traffic lights take a right hand turn and proceed straight on until you enter the Paddocks development.\n"
      },
      {
